    'æ‹…å¿ƒç¬¬ä¸‰æ–¹å·¥å…·å®‰å…¨æ€§ä¸ä½³ï¼Ÿæˆ‘ä»¬å…¨éƒ¨é›†æˆå®˜æ–¹ç½‘ç«™ï¼Œåªåšå‰ç«¯ä¸åšæœåŠ¡å™¨'
  ];

  getAccentColor(): string {
    let colorTheme: string = AppStorage.get<string>('appColorTheme') as string || 'blue';
    let colorMap: Record<string, string> = {
      'blue': '#3B82F6',
      'green': '#059669',
      'orange': '#EA580C',
      'purple': '#7C3AED',
      'cyan': '#0891B2',
      'rose': '#E11D48'
    };
    return colorMap[colorTheme] || '#3B82F6';
  }

  isDarkMode(): boolean {
    return ThemeHelper.isEffectiveDarkMode(this.appTheme, this.currentColorMode);
  }

  openPrivacyUrl(): void {
    let url: string = 'https://agreement-drcn.hispace.dbankcloud.cn/index.html?lang=zh&agreementId=1931500322883123520';
    try {
      router.pushUrl({
        url: 'pages/WebPage',
        params: {
          url: url,
          title: 'éšç§åè®®'
        }
      });
    } catch (e) {
      console.error('openPrivacyUrl error', JSON.stringify(e));
    }
  }

  closePage(): void {
    router.back();
  }

  build() {
    Column() {
      Row() {
        Button() {
          SymbolGlyph($r('sys.symbol.arrow_left'))
            .fontSize(20)
            .fontColor([$r('app.color.text_primary')])
        }
        .width(36)
        .height(36)
        .backgroundColor(Color.Transparent)
        .borderRadius(18)
        .onClick(() => {
          this.closePage();
        })

        Blank()

        Text('å…³äºåº”ç”¨')
          .fontSize(18)
          .fontWeight(FontWeight.Bold)
          .fontColor($r('app.color.text_primary'))
          .margin({ left: -36 })

        Blank()
      }
      .width('100%')
      .height(48)
      .padding({ left: 12, right: 12 })

      Scroll() {
        Column() {
          // Privacy
          Column() {
            Text('éšç§åè®®')
              .fontSize(16)
              .fontWeight(FontWeight.Medium)
              .fontColor($r('app.color.text_primary'))
              .margin({ bottom: 8 })

            Text('å…³äºAIä¸€ç«™æ¸…ä¸éšç§çš„å£°æ˜')
              .fontSize(14)
              .fontColor(this.getAccentColor())
              .onClick(() => {
                this.openPrivacyUrl();
              })
          }
          .width('100%')
          .padding(16)
          .backgroundColor($r('app.color.bg_card'))
          .borderRadius(16)
          .margin({ bottom: 12 })

          // Updates
          Column() {
            Text('æ›´æ–°åŠ¨æ€')
              .fontSize(16)
              .fontWeight(FontWeight.Medium)
              .fontColor($r('app.color.text_primary'))
              .margin({ bottom: 8 })

            Text('Version 11')
              .fontSize(13)
              .fontWeight(FontWeight.Medium)
              .fontColor(this.getAccentColor())
              .margin({ bottom: 12 })

            Column() {
              ForEach(this.updateLogs, (log: string) => {
                Row() {
                  Text('Â·')
                    .fontSize(14)
                    .fontColor(this.getAccentColor())
                    .margin({ right: 6 })
                  Text(log)
                    .fontSize(13)
                    .fontColor($r('app.color.text_secondary'))
                    .lineHeight(20)
                }
                .width('100%')
                .alignItems(VerticalAlign.Top)
                .margin({ bottom: 4 })
              }, (log: string) => log)
            }
          }
          .width('100%')
          .padding(16)
          .backgroundColor($r('app.color.bg_card'))
          .borderRadius(16)
          .margin({ bottom: 12 })

          // Features
          Column() {
            Text('åŠŸèƒ½ä»‹ç»')
              .fontSize(16)
              .fontWeight(FontWeight.Medium)
              .fontColor($r('app.color.text_primary'))
              .margin({ bottom: 8 })

            Text('AI ä¸€ç«™æ¸… æ˜¯ä¸€æ¬¾é¸¿è’™ç‰ˆä¸€ç«™å¼ AI è§£å†³å¹³å°')
              .fontSize(13)
              .fontColor($r('app.color.text_secondary'))
              .margin({ bottom: 12 })

            Column() {
              ForEach(this.featureList, (feature: string) => {
                Row() {
                  Text('Â·')
                    .fontSize(14)
                    .fontColor(this.getAccentColor())
                    .margin({ right: 6 })
                  Text(feature)
                    .fontSize(13)
                    .fontColor($r('app.color.text_secondary'))
                    .lineHeight(20)
                }
                .width('100%')
                .alignItems(VerticalAlign.Top)
                .margin({ bottom: 4 })
              }, (feature: string) => feature)
            }
          }
          .width('100%')
          .padding(16)
          .backgroundColor($r('app.color.bg_card'))
          .borderRadius(16)
          .margin({ bottom: 12 })

          // Open Source
          Column() {
            Text('æŠ€æœ¯å¼€æº')
              .fontSize(16)
              .fontWeight(FontWeight.Medium)
              .fontColor($r('app.color.text_primary'))
              .margin({ bottom: 8 })

            Text('æœ¬åº”ç”¨ç»è¿‡æ¶æ„é‡å†™ï¼Œé‡‡ç”¨ArkTSå’ŒC++åŸç”Ÿå¼€å‘ï¼Œå¸¦æ¥æè‡´çš„åŸç”Ÿæµç•…ä½“éªŒ')
              .fontSize(13)
              .fontColor($r('app.color.text_secondary'))
              .lineHeight(20)
              .margin({ bottom: 8 })

            Text('ç§‰æŒå¼€æºå¼€æ”¾ã€å…±å»ºå…±äº«çš„ç²¾ç¥ï¼Œæ­¤åº”ç”¨å°†å¼€æºåœ¨githubå¹³å°ï¼Œä½ å¯ä»¥å®¡è®¡æ¯ä¸€è¡Œä»£ç ï¼Œæ¬¢è¿å­¦ä¹ ã€äº¤æµ')
              .fontSize(13)
              .fontColor($r('app.color.text_secondary'))
              .lineHeight(20)
              .margin({ bottom: 8 })

            Text('æˆ‘çš„ GitHub ä¸»é¡µï¼š')
              .fontSize(13)
              .fontColor($r('app.color.text_secondary'))
              .margin({ bottom: 4 })

            Text('https://github.com/zhubowen-bot')
              .fontSize(13)
              .fontColor(this.getAccentColor())
              .lineHeight(20)
          }
          .width('100%')
          .padding(16)
          .backgroundColor($r('app.color.bg_card'))
          .borderRadius(16)
          .margin({ bottom: 32 })
        }
        .width('100%')
        .padding({ left: 16, right: 16, top: 20 })
        .expandSafeArea([SafeAreaType.SYSTEM], [SafeAreaEdge.BOTTOM])
      }
      .layoutWeight(1)
      .width('100%')
      .clip(false)
      .edgeEffect(EdgeEffect.Spring)
      .scrollBar(BarState.Off)
    }
    .width('100%')
    .height('100%')
    .backgroundColor($r('app.color.bg_primary'))
    .expandSafeArea([SafeAreaType.SYSTEM], [SafeAreaEdge.BOTTOM])
  }
}

